WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:07.378
Your child reads ten words. There are no pictures, and the words are in a new order.

3
00:00:07.828 --> 00:00:12.546
Do not help on this page. Your child may use the slide card. That is allowed.

4
00:00:12.996 --> 00:00:15.054
Mark each word read right, and count.

5
00:00:15.504 --> 00:00:17.378
Eight or more, go on to day six.

6
00:00:17.828 --> 00:00:23.484
Fewer than eight, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

7
00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:29.388
Then play the game on the next page. Your child reads each stone, slowly, and colors it.

8
00:00:29.838 --> 00:00:35.194
The rule of the game: a guess sends you back one stone. Slow and careful gets to the end.
